  "scope": "Add fixture-backed native link-status presentation through the existing snapshot-bound VaultSession resolver, without writing vault content.",
  "behavior": [
    "The UI lets the user choose a Markdown note and resolve its wiki links, Markdown links and embeds through VaultSession on a Rayon worker.",
    "The panel displays resolved, ambiguous, unresolved and external counts plus every reference's kind, raw text, target, candidates, alias and subpath.",
    "Resolution runs are serialized with history and rename operations; cached statuses are invalidated after rename, and resolver errors are mapped to safe UI messages.",
    "The shared link-resolution fixture drives the production egui interaction and verifies displayed statuses, targets, candidates, counts and unchanged vault bytes."
  ],
